<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2014/Shelburne-Glebe-barns.jpg" alt="A landscape painting with an arrangement of gray barns set against a rose gray sky" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Barns on Shelburne Glebe Road. 8x10, oil on linen panel. 2014</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I painted this small landscape with deliberately subdued colors and spent most of my time focused on the way the light wraps around the tops of the trees. &nbsp;There are a lot of architectural elements in the painting, but the way they are obscured by the foreground trees made them relatively easy to paint.</p>